Test files for CD4510 and CD4516 counter ICs
============================================

The PIC12F1840 firmware is a No-Op loop and the chip is only present as
the simulation will not run without a microcontroller. Actual control
is all via buttons attached directly to the CD451x chip.


To build:

$ make


To run using CD4510 (BCD counter):

$ make cd4510


To run using CD4516 (binary counter):

$ make cd4516
